From: LeavesMC <noreply@leavesmc.org>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ModernFix cache stronghold ring positions

Caches the concentric-ring stronghold positions per (world, structure set,
placement geometry, effective seed) so repeated queries do not resample the
whole ring set and re-run the biome predicate for every candidate.

This patch is Powered by ModernFix(https://github.com/embeddedt/ModernFix)

This patch is based on the following mixins:
* "org/embeddedt/modernfix/common/mixin/perf/cache_strongholds/*.java"
By: embeddedt
As part of: ModernFix (https://github.com/embeddedt/ModernFix)
Licensed under: LGPL-3.0 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html)

Two deliberate deviations from upstream:

1. The cache key uses the *effective* ring seed. Paper lets the server
   configured `stronghold-seed` override `concentricRingsSeed`, and the
   upstream mod only keys on the latter, so servers using that option would
   read stale ring positions.
2. The dedicated ring-computation thread pool is not ported. Upstream creates
   a fresh pool per call and shuts it down in a `finally`, which races with
   the asynchronous tasks it just submitted. The shared background executor is
   kept instead; the cache is where the win is.

The cache is in-memory only and never evicted; entries are keyed by the
generator state identity, so a world that is unloaded and reloaded in one
process is recomputed rather than served stale data.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/ChunkGeneratorStructureState.java b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/ChunkGeneratorStructureState.java
index 8547fccf2216867147adcefa3e58a2c9ce58eadb..e9f8427205752c53ca02e20399fa0279dfc1628a 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/ChunkGeneratorStructureState.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/level/chunk/ChunkGeneratorStructureState.java
@@ -172,6 +172,28 @@ public class ChunkGeneratorStructureState {
     }
 
     private CompletableFuture<List<ChunkPos>> generateRingPositions(final Holder<StructureSet> structureSet, final ConcentricRingsStructurePlacement placement) {
+        // Leaves start - modernfix: cache stronghold ring positions
+        if (org.snowballmc.snowball.LeavesConfig.performance.modernfixCacheStrongholds) {
+            return org.snowballmc.snowball.modernfix.bridge.StrongholdCache.wrap(this, structureSet, placement,
+                    this.leaves$effectiveRingSeed(structureSet),
+                    () -> this.leaves$generateRingPositions0(structureSet, placement));
+        }
+        // Leaves end - modernfix: cache stronghold ring positions
+        return this.leaves$generateRingPositions0(structureSet, placement);
+    }
+
+    // Leaves start - modernfix: cache stronghold ring positions
+    private long leaves$effectiveRingSeed(final Holder<StructureSet> structureSet) {
+        // Paper 会让服务器配置的 stronghold-seed 覆盖 concentricRingsSeed，
+        // 缓存键必须用「实际生效」的那个，否则配了 stronghold-seed 的服务器会读到错误环位。
+        return this.config.strongholdSeed != null
+                && structureSet.is(net.minecraft.world.level.levelgen.structure.BuiltinStructureSets.STRONGHOLDS)
+                ? this.config.strongholdSeed
+                : this.concentricRingsSeed;
+    }
+    // Leaves end - modernfix: cache stronghold ring positions
+
+    private CompletableFuture<List<ChunkPos>> leaves$generateRingPositions0(final Holder<StructureSet> structureSet, final ConcentricRingsStructurePlacement placement) {
         if (placement.count() == 0) {
             return CompletableFuture.completedFuture(List.of());
         }
